{
	"Name": "AlertQuery - Okta - Application - OAuth2 - Okta OAuth2 Scope Denied or Client Credentials Rejected",
	"Description": "An OAuth2 authorization was refused because the client asked for a scope it is not allowed, or presented invalid client credentials. A client repeatedly asking for scopes it does not have is enumerating what it can reach.\n\nEvent types: app.oauth2.as.authorize.scope_denied, app.oauth2.invalid_client_credentials\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/elastic/detection-rules/integrations/okta/privilege_escalation_unauthorized_scope_for_public_app_oauth2_token_grant_with_client_credentials/\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/reference/api/event-types/",
